      "comment": "Haden: Natlan stronghold and the Loom of Fate",
      "content": "In A Space and Time Without You, Haden, as the Iniquitous Baptist commanding the Abyss Order base, told Dainsleif that the Traveler's sibling had used the Loom of Fate to re-weave Khaenri'ah's Ley Lines. He later admitted the claim was false: Ley Lines are the collected memories of a place, the weaving was unfinished, and the Order's soldiers had been meditating to feed memories to the Loom. He needed Dainsleif's memories and sacrificed his army to obtain them.",
